'''Soul Catcher''' is a [[unique]] {{il|Quartz Flask}}.

==Mechanics==
{{c|mod|Cannot gain Mana during effect}}: While this disables mana recovery from flasks, it does not disable life recovery based on mana recovery from flasks, such as from {{il|Runegraft of Quaffing}} or {{il|Indigon}}.

{{Item acquisition}}

==Ruthless mode==
Utility Flasks cannot gain charges while active in [[Ruthless mode]]. This flask also has a flask duration of 4.00 seconds instead.

==Legacy variants==
Soul Catcher has [[legacy variant]]s.

{{legacy variant table header}}
{{legacy variant table row|3.15.0|
* Cannot gain Mana during effect
* {{c|mod|Vaal Skills have (80-120)% increased Critical Strike Chance during effect}}
* {{c|mod|Vaal Skills deal (80-120)% increased Damage during effect}}
* {{c|mod|Vaal Skills used during effect have (40-20)% reduced Soul Gain Prevention Duration}}
}}
{{legacy variant table row|3.10.0|
* Cannot gain Mana during effect
* {{c|mod|Vaal Skills deal (60-100)% increased Damage during effect}}
* {{c|mod|Non-Aura Vaal Skills require 25% reduced Souls Per Use during Effect}}
* {{c|mod|Vaal Skills used during effect have (40-20)% reduced Soul Gain Prevention Duration}}
}}
{{Legacy variant table end}}

