* Now has 'Vaal Skills have 60-80% increased Critical Strike Chance during effect' (previously 80-120%), and 'Vaal Skills deal 60-80% increased Damage during effect (previously 80-120%). Vaal skills used during effect now have 10% reduced Soul Gain Prevention (previously 20-40%). Existing versions can be updated to the new values with a Divine Orb.
